  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "Every **DRUKHARI** unit has a Pain ability, which works only while that unit is Empowered. With **DRUKHARI** as your Army Faction, you Empower units by spending tokens from your Pain token pool. You gain 1 Pain token:\n\n- as your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins\n- for every destroyed enemy unit\n- for every enemy unit that fails a [Battle-shock test](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock)\n\nEach unit's Pain ability says when you can spend tokens to Empower it. An Empowered unit has all its Pain abilities for the rest of the phase; in an Attached unit, that covers every Leader and Bodyguard unit in it for one payment.\n\nEnhancements, Stratagems and some other rules can spend Pain tokens too.",
